# G1141: The previous sys.boot_completed/USB bootstrap action wrote
# "change" to /sys/class/udc/12480000.usb/uevent.
# Physically measured at boot: init -> sysfs:file write DENIED by SELinux
# Enforcing; gadget was already configured and ADB worked. Thus the action
# never performed a kernel uevent and was a harmless failed operation.
# Keep the existing verified vendor.smt311.usb.bootstrap logic in its own
# source service; do not grant broad init sysfs write permissions, force
# reenumeration, or modify ADB/MTP/OTG/SELinux behavior to silence a log.
# Deliberately no init actions in this file.
